            "slot": "s2959",
            "repere": "Paragraphe · I absolutely LOVE the half-pad. I've had",
            "text": "I absolutely LOVE the half-pad. I've had several rides in it and even with the extremely warm and humid weather we've had lately, it's held up, not slipped, and been the perfect half-pad for my gelding as well as my client horse that I used it on. I have always heard wonderful things about Kavallarie and finally decided to try it out for myself. 10/10!",
