            "repere": "Titre H3 · Amazing Half Pad",
            "text": "Amazing Half Pad",
            "image": "",
            "link": ""
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "element",
          "settings": {
            "slot": "s2994",
            "repere": "Paragraphe · Incredibly impressed with this half pad.",
            "text": "Incredibly impressed with this half pad. The gel and foam combination is amazing at shock absorption. My horse feels like a much smoother ride and I sit quieter in the saddle for flat work and jumping. It took a few times saddling to get used to how this half pad sits, as you don't really pull it up into the pommel. The gel is quite sticky. I do use a thinner saddle pad. I have nice even, solid sweat lines after my rides. Easy to hose right off if needed. If you are debating, I highly recommend this pad!",
            "image": "",
            "link": ""
          }
        },
