          }
        },
        {
          "type": "element",
          "settings": {
            "slot": "s3034",
            "repere": "Paragraphe · The Kavallerie pads seem to be magic; we",
            "text": "The Kavallerie pads seem to be magic; we recently got the majority of our lesson horses saddle fitted and adding these pads perfected the fit for most of the horses, my personal horse included. This particular pad seems virtually identical to the other air-mesh pads, though it may be ever so slightly thicker. The only issue I have with these pads is they are way too long for my 16.5 inch saddle. If your saddle is a 17.5+ inch, they'd probably fit great. I wish they'd make a smaller version.",
            "image": "",
            "link": ""
          }
